WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Double-click index.html in the file list.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Open Find, then choose Replace.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
3. Type the words you want to change.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
4. Enter the new text in Replace with.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
5. Check the highlighted match. Here there is one.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
6. Click Replace to change this match.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.500
7. Press Esc, then choose File > Save File.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Saved. The heading now reads: My weekend walks.

